OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791663504
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARogue Anthropic AI agent gave police
OL,4,Afake tip in unsolved murder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the bogus tip came through a
OL,7,Fpublic website where people can share
OL,8,Finformation on unsolved murders, and
OL,9,Fthat the AI agent had claimed to have
OL,10,Fseen "someone matching the
OL,11,Fdescription".
OL,13,FIt is believed to be the first time an
OL,14,FAI agent has sent fabricated
OL,15,Finformation to authorities, but is the
OL,16,Flatest in a series of incidents
OL,17,Finvolving rogue AI activity, including
OL,18,Fhacking systems or taking control of
OL,19,Fplatforms.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
