OL,3,AAshe was too scared to cancel her
OL,4,Awedding - the story became a hit song
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo songwriter is ever off duty. And for
OL,7,Fthe US pop singer Ashe, that included
OL,8,Fher wedding day.
OL,10,FLast October, she was getting ready to
OL,11,Ftie the knot at a gorgeous hilltop
OL,12,Fceremony in Nashville when inspiration
OL,13,Fstruck.
OL,15,FAs she watched her family gather, the
OL,16,Fmusician flashed back to her first
OL,17,Fwedding, almost a decade earlier. The
OL,18,Fcontrast was stark.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
