OL,3,AAshe was too scared to cancel her
OL,4,Awedding - the story became a hit song
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe's called that first marriage
OL,7,F"horrifying". Her ex, who she met in
OL,8,Fcollege, was, she says, emotionally
OL,9,Fmanipulative and psychologically
OL,10,Fabusive.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
